#. Translators: announced after a panel was closed. {panel} is its name, such as Artifacts.
msgid "Closed: {panel}"
msgstr "נסגר: {panel}"

#. Translators: announced when no open panel was found.
msgid "No panel to close"
msgstr "לא נמצא פאנל לסגירה"

#. Translators: the prompt above the list of open panels.
msgid "Choose a panel to close"
msgstr "בחר פאנל לסגירה"

#. Translators: the title of the dialog that lists the open panels.
msgid "Close a panel in Claude"
msgstr "סגירת פאנל ב-Claude"

#. Translators: announced when pressing the close button did not work. {panel} is its name.
msgid "Could not close: {panel}"
msgstr "הסגירה נכשלה: {panel}"

#. Translators: announced after the diagnostics command wrote to the NVDA log.
msgid "Diagnostics written to the NVDA log"
msgstr "פרטי האבחון נכתבו ללוג של NVDA"

#. Translators: describes the close panel command in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Closes the panel that has the focus, or lists the open panels"
msgstr "סוגר את הפאנל שהפוקוס בתוכו, או מציג רשימה של הפאנלים הפתוחים"

#. Translators: describes the diagnostics command in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Writes diagnostics about the focus and the panels to the NVDA log"
msgstr "כותב ללוג של NVDA פרטי אבחון על הפוקוס ועל הפאנלים"
